    {
      "bbox": [
        192,
        723,
        1466,
        840
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the \"Affordable New York\" program, authorized by subdivision (16) of section 421-a of the Real Property Tax Law, was enacted in 2017 to provide tax exemptions to residential construction projects that include affordable housing; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2154,
          "min": -1.0762
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 55,
          "mean": -0.0018,
          "min": -0.089
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 17511,
        "area_px": 146952,
        "density": 0.11916,
        "chars": 241,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        877,
        1477,
        1032
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, in order to obtain Affordable New York real property tax benefits, an Affordable New York project that commenced construction after December 31, 2015 and on or before June 15, 2022 must receive a temporary or permanent certificate of occupancy covering all residential areas from the Department of Buildings on or before June 15, 2026; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1973,
          "min": -1.0199
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 81,
          "mean": -0.0012,
          "min": -0.0792
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 25254,
        "area_px": 196385,
        "density": 0.12859,
        "chars": 348,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.78
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1070,
        1444,
        1187
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, any project that has not yet received a temporary or permanent certificate of occupancy covering all residential areas from the Department of Buildings is at risk of not meeting the June 15, 2026 completion deadline (\"at-risk projects\"); and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1907,
          "min": -1.0928
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 53,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0025
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 17472,
        "area_px": 144378,
        "density": 0.12102,
        "chars": 250,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.31
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1225,
        1387,
        1302
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, New York City is experiencing a housing crisis that is best addressed through the production of additional housing at all levels of affordability; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1583,
          "min": -0.9253
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 28,
          "mean": -0.0022,
          "min": -0.062
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11445,
        "area_px": 90629,
        "density": 0.12628,
        "chars": 159,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.89
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1340,
        1416,
        1418
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, an interagency approach is critical for the City to implement reforms to increase the likelihood that all at-risk projects will meet the 2026 deadline;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1608,
          "min": -0.9382
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 34,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0034
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11638,
        "area_px": 95274,
        "density": 0.12215,
        "chars": 160,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.75
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1457,
        1448,
        1530
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as Mayor of the City of New York, it is hereby ordered:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1718,
          "min": -0.8858
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
