      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(a) The Task Force shall be chaired by the Deputy Mayor for Housing, Economic Development and Workforce or such Deputy Mayor's designee (the \"Chair\"), or the successor to such Deputy Mayor or their designee.",
      "logprob_stats": {
